------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
a single go prg is a process which has mutliple goroutines

these go routines may be bundled into threads → by the Go scheduler
```
eg : there are 16 goroutines 
ur cpu has 2 physical cores → 2*2 logical cores → 4 cores → 4 threads
and each thread can handle 4 goroutines concurrently
thread 1 → go1 go2 go3 go4
thread 2→ go4 go5 go6 go7
```
within each thread all the go routines work concurrently

and all threads run lly

all these go routines bundling in thread are managed by `go scheduler`
